# Project: Track Quality Pack Web Application

## Objective

Build a production-ready web application that converts the Track Quality Pack Excel workbook stored in this repository into a digital, responsive Track Quality Pack.

The application will be deployed to Microsoft Azure and used by railway engineering staff on:

- Windows laptops
- iPads
- iPhones

The application must retain the structure, terminology, functionality, and general appearance of the source Excel and Word documents wherever practical.

Do not create a generic form application. First inspect the documents in the repository and use their worksheets, fields, formatting, formulas, named ranges, validation rules, and document layout as the authoritative source for the application design.

