# 2. Application Structure

Each relevant worksheet in the Track Quality Pack workbook must become a separate section or route in the application.

Use the worksheet names as the basis for the section names, but convert them into safe URL routes.

Provide:

- A clear application header
- Track Quality Pack status
- Section navigation
- Previous and Next buttons
- Save button
- Save status indicator
- Validation summary
- Export menu
- Responsive mobile navigation
- Clear indication of the currently selected site

The user must be able to move between sections without losing entered information.

