Provide at least:

- Freehand drawing
- Straight line
- Arrow
- Rectangle
- Text box
- Highlight tool
- Colour selection
- Line thickness selection
- Undo
- Redo
- Select and move
- Delete annotation
- Clear annotations with confirmation

Store annotations as structured overlay data, such as JSON containing coordinates, page number, tool type, colour, and dimensions. Do not save only a flattened screenshot.

Ensure annotations remain correctly positioned when the page is resized or viewed on another device.

