# 12. Track Quality Pack Workflow

Support at least the following statuses:

- Draft
- In progress
- Ready for review
- Complete
- Archived

Users must be able to:

- Create a new Track Quality Pack
- Reopen an existing pack
- Edit a draft
- Save progress
- Duplicate a pack where appropriate
- View validation issues
- Mark a pack ready for review
- Export the pack
- Archive a completed pack

Prevent silent overwriting where two sessions attempt to edit the same pack. Use an updated timestamp, version number, or another optimistic concurrency method.

