# 13. Autosave and Offline Resilience

The application will be used on operational sites where connectivity may be poor.

Implement:

- Debounced autosave
- Visible save status
- Clear save failure warnings
- Retry behaviour for temporary failures
- Protection against accidental navigation with unsaved changes
- Local retention of unsaved form changes where practical
- Safe synchronisation when the connection returns

Do not claim that the application is fully offline unless all required offline functions are genuinely implemented and tested.

Images awaiting upload must be clearly identified.

