# 22. Acceptance Criteria

The implementation is acceptable when:

- Every relevant source worksheet has a corresponding application section.
- TQS Form data automatically populates mapped fields in other sections.
- The application supports one or multiple sites.
- Site-specific content is stored independently.
- A user can take and upload photographs from a mobile device.
- Refusing location permission does not stop photograph capture.
- Selected PDF pages can be annotated and saved.
- Trace and CCQ Chart images can be uploaded and annotated.
- TEF3071 and TEF3207 retain their required function and recognisable layout.
- Data remains after refresh, logout, and login.
- Database credentials are not present in the repository or browser bundle.
- The final Excel file opens correctly and follows the source workbook structure.
- The final PDF contains all applicable sections and annotations.
- The application is usable on laptops, iPads, and iPhones.
- Critical workflows have automated tests.
- Deployment and configuration are documented.

